nd a hiding spot or escape before it\u2019s too late.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526450/extras/088daa795637ea6279667f0ea8964ee8.poster.avif?t=1753375482\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526450/extras/088daa795637ea6279667f0ea8964ee8.webm?t=1753375482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526450/extras/ab0beeb26ad4b759ec9d2be4af79a733.avif?t=1753375482\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Three Dreamstones</strong><br>The only way out of your nightmare is to find all three dreamstones. Complete tasks that help you unlock new areas, solve puzzles and search for clues to locate them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help Others </strong><br>Assist the mysterious figures trapped in your dream to earn valuable hints, useful items, and new opportunities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526450/extras/81e7d5e3288c32581a881544fa9157d8.poster.avif?t=1753375482\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526450/extras/81e7d5e3288c32581a881544fa9157d8.webm?t=1753375482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
